B.Fg=new A.cE(B.a2C,B.a4s)
B.a4q=new A.U("Puksain ang daga","Get rid of rats and mice")
B.a2N=new A.U("Daga ang pangunahing nagdadala nito. Takpan ang pinagtataguan nila, walisin ang natapong pakain, at isara nang mabuti ang lalagyan.","Rats and mice are the main carriers. Block where they hide, sweep up spilled feed, and keep feed tightly closed.")
B.FG=new A.cE(B.a4q,B.a2N)
B.a4F=new A.U("Tingnan ang pakain","Check the feed")
B.a3w=new A.U("Madalas nagsisimula ito sa marumi o inaamag na pakain. Tanungin ang pinagbilhan at tingnan ang petsa.","It often starts from dirty or mouldy feed. Ask the seller and check the date on the bag.")
B.Fi=new A.cE(B.a4F,B.a3w)
B.a4C=new A.U("Magtanong muna sa beterinaryo bago magpagamot","Ask a vet before giving medicine")
B.a3O=new A.U("Puwedeng kailangan ng antibiotic \u2014 pero may araw na dapat hintayin bago puwedeng ibenta ang karne at itlog. Ang maling gamot ay nakakasama pa.","Antibiotics may be needed \u2014 but you must wait some days before selling meat and eggs. The wrong medicine can do harm.")
